    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Byterage: Epic Battle Against the Quantum Legion </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Byteplex City is shrouded in darkness as the ruthless Quantum Legion seizes control, spreading chaos and fear throughout the city. However, there is one last beacon of hope: Steel X. Armed with a katana, this hero embarks on a mission to eradicate all evil and restore freedom to the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155630/extras/01badc7c398baf5ae2817c8605f8ca6b.poster.avif?t=1755254104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155630/extras/01badc7c398baf5ae2817c8605f8ca6b.webm?t=1755254104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155630/extras/01badc7c398baf5ae2817c8605f8ca6b.mp4?t=1755254104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Stunning Cyberpunk and Sci-Fi Graphics: Byteplex City dazzles with its neon lights and futuristic designs, creating a cyberpunk dream. Every corner of the city is meticulously crafted, transporting you to a vision of technological advancement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2192 Fast-Paced and Fluid Action: Steel X\u2019s combat mechanics offer an immersive and dynamic action experience. With swift movements, impressive combos, and sharp reflexes, the battles keep your adrenaline levels high. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Challenging Experience: Confronting Quantum Legion\u2019s powerful laser weapons requires real skill. Tough levels and strategy-demanding fights keep you on edge, offering a true test of your abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2192 Incredible Character Gameplay: Steel X\u2019s impressive combat skills and katana moves provide an enjoyable experience in every battle. Discover your character\u2019s development and abilities, and gain the upper hand in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Slow Time to Dodge Bullets: Steel X has the ability to slow down time, allowing you to dodge bullets and gain a strategic advantage. Use this feature to evade enemy fire and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your courage to change Byteplex City\u2019s fate and put an end to the Quantum Legion\u2019s dark influence. Join Steel X in this unforgettable fight and become the legendary hero the city needs!</p>",
