our abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u2192 Incredible Character Gameplay: Steel X\u2019s impressive combat skills and katana moves provide an enjoyable experience in every battle. Discover your character\u2019s development and abilities, and gain the upper hand in combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Slow Time to Dodge Bullets: Steel X has the ability to slow down time, allowing you to dodge bullets and gain a strategic advantage. Use this feature to evade enemy fire and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your courage to change Byteplex City\u2019s fate and put an end to the Quantum Legion\u2019s dark influence. Join Steel X in this unforgettable fight and become the legendary hero the city needs!</p>",
